  TOON (Token-Oriented Object Notation) is a lossless JSON re-encoding
  that eliminates JSON syntax overhead (quotes, commas, colons,
  braces), achieving 30-60% token savings on structured/tabular data.
  Statically linked into the tokenless binaries as a sequential second
  stage after ResponseCompressor.

